t $\\text{_______}\\,.$ *" 13194139534844 true] [17592186314224 1113 #uuid "37d9c80f-2cd5-546e-9463-84b02d5e64b9" 13194139534844 true] [17592186314224 1145 "Given that $f(x)$ is continuous on $[a,b]$ and differentiable on  $(a,b)$, the mean value theorem states the following: \n\n*There exists a point $c\\in (a,b)$ such that*\n\n$$\n{f}^{′}(c)=\\frac{f(b)-f(a)}{b-a}.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have $a=-5$ and $b=4.$ Thus, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(c) & =\\frac{f(4)-f(-5)}{4-(-5)} \\\\  & =\\frac{7-2}{4+5} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the complete sentence is as follows:\n\n *The mean value theorem states that there exists a point $c\\in (-5,4)$ such that ${f}^{′}(c)=\\frac{5}{9}.$*" 13194139534844 true] [17592186314225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186314226 13194139534844 true] [17592186314225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186314227 13194139534844 true] [17592186314225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186314228 13194139534844 true] [17592186314225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186314229 13194139534844 true] [17592186314225 1000 #edb/ref 17592186314230 13194139534844 true] [17592186314225 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534844 true] [17592186314225 1041 "selection" 13194139534844 true] [17592186314225 1104 #edb/ref 17592186314227 13194139534844 true] [17592186314225 1110 #uuid "52164d79-ea96-5cd6-a8b0-6bd7485d4f2a" 13194139534844 true] [17592186314226 1034 "{f}^{′}(c)=9" 13194139534844 true] [17592186314226 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534844 true] [17592186314226 1111 #uuid "fc868210-90c8-5aef-8a96-299b3c7236db" 13194139534844 true] [17592186314227 1034 "{f}^{′}(c)=\\frac{5}{9}" 13194139534844 true] [17592186314227 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534844 true] [17592186314227 1111 #uuid "dd764a30-26f8-5243-9774-99f981dcac04" 13194139534844 true] [17592186314228 1034 "{f}^{′}(c)=-\\frac{5}{9}" 13194139534844 true] [17592186314228 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534844 true] [17592186314228 1111 #uuid "d3e66a85-4cec-555e-926c-267fb5074e37" 13194139534844 true] [17